// Bandit Level 2 → Level 3

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 2 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit2@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 1.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `spaces in this filename` is present.

Step5: Since the filename contains spaces, use quotes to specify the complete filename:

        cat "spaces in this filename"

Step6: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit3`.

Step7: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit3@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step8: The Bandit Level 2 → Level 3 challenge is solved.

Step9: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
